{"id":"n2-081","title":"～てからでないと (〜te kara denai to)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Indicates that something cannot be done before a certain action is completed; 'not until', 'only after'.","longExplanation":"The ～てからでないと grammar point is used to express that an action cannot be done before another action has been completed. It can be translated as 'not until' or 'only after' in English. It attaches to a verb in the て-form, plus からでないと.","formation":"Verb-て + からでないと","examples":[{"jp":"宿題をしてからでないと、遊びに行けません。","romaji":"Shukudai o shite kara denai to, asobi ni ikemasen.","en":"You cannot go play until you’ve finished your homework.","words":[{"surface":"宿題","vocabId":"1337270","reading":"しゅくだい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遊び","vocabId":"1542070","reading":"あそび"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行け","vocabId":"1631370","reading":"いける","baseForm":"行ける"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6,7]},{"jp":"食事をしてからでないと、デザートを食べられません。","romaji":"Shokuji o shite kara denai to, dezāto o taberaremasen.","en":"You cannot eat dessert until after having a meal.","words":[{"surface":"食事","vocabId":"1358490","reading":"しょくじ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"デザート","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"られ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"られる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6,7]},{"jp":"チケットを買ってからでないと、映画を見られません。","romaji":"Chiketto o katte kara denai to, eiga o miraremasen.","en":"You can’t watch the movie until after you buy a ticket.","words":[{"surface":"チケット","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"買っ","vocabId":"1473740","reading":"かう","baseForm":"買う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる","baseForm":"見る"},{"surface":"られ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"られる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6,7]},{"jp":"試験が終わってからでないと、休みを取れません。","romaji":"Shiken ga owatte kara denai to, yasumi o toremasen.","en":"You can’t take time off until the exam is over.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"終わっ","vocabId":"1589600","reading":"おわる","baseForm":"終わる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"休み","vocabId":"1227500","reading":"やすみ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"取れ","vocabId":"1326990","reading":"とれる","baseForm":"取れる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6,7]}]}